WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:58.855
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:59.125 --> 01:04.000
[Apocalypse Log 24]

3
01:28.580 --> 01:30.880
You're He Yao's brother.

4
01:34.833 --> 01:36.633
Aren't you supposed to be...

5
01:38.750 --> 01:40.000
I knew it.

6
01:40.000 --> 01:42.841
He Yao's videos were all faked.

7
01:43.542 --> 01:45.342
Why are you here?

8
01:47.292 --> 01:49.583
You must be Lin Zai.

9
01:49.583 --> 01:51.750
I'm Sheng Chang Huan.

10
01:51.750 --> 01:56.916
I'm sorry to meet you under these circumstances.

11
01:56.916 --> 01:58.917
I'm sorry.

12
01:58.917 --> 02:00.717
He Yao lied to you.

13
02:02.708 --> 02:07.383
Everything he did to you was because of me.

14
02:10.125 --> 02:12.175
What exactly happened?

15
02:14.250 --> 02:16.425
After the virus outbreak,

16
02:17.042 --> 02:20.167
we wanted to research a vaccine together.

17
02:20.167 --> 02:22.714
I wanted to beat him...

18
02:22.714 --> 02:25.050
to prove myself.

19
02:26.138 --> 02:28.188
So, behind his back,

20
02:29.708 --> 02:34.050
I used myself for the first human experiment.

21
02:37.375 --> 02:41.883
I never expected that I'd end up like this...

22
02:42.625 --> 02:45.675
A half-human, half-zombie monster.

23
02:47.100 --> 02:49.000
He Yao...

24
02:49.000 --> 02:51.791
He Yao refused to give up on me.

25
02:51.791 --> 02:52.916
That's why...

26
02:52.916 --> 02:54.083
So, from the very beginning,

27
02:54.083 --> 02:56.977
you weren't a real zombie.

28
03:02.750 --> 03:04.958
But regardless,

29
03:04.958 --> 03:08.341
He Yao shouldn't have used my brother to deceive me.

30
03:10.625 --> 03:12.042
I'm sorry.

31
03:12.042 --> 03:14.050
I'm truly sorry.

32
03:15.000 --> 03:17.591
He Yao wasn't always like this.

33
03:19.958 --> 03:22.092
He was the kindest person

34
03:22.833 --> 03:25.958
I had ever known.

35
03:25.958 --> 03:27.791
It's me.

36
03:27.791 --> 03:31.000
I'm the one who turned him into this.

37
03:31.000 --> 03:33.133
It's all my fault.

38
03:34.958 --> 03:37.083
I know.

39
03:37.083 --> 03:39.333
I know he's wronged you all.

40
03:39.333 --> 03:43.833
What he did is unforgivable.

41
03:43.833 --> 03:46.750
But... I'm begging you.

42
03:46.750 --> 03:49.583
I'm really begging you.

43
03:49.583 --> 03:52.093
Everything he owes you,

44
03:52.093 --> 03:53.958
I'll pay it back.

45
03:53.958 --> 03:55.333
What do you mean?

46
03:55.333 --> 03:56.925
I...

47
03:59.959 --> 04:01.550
What's wrong with you?

48
04:19.916 --> 04:21.750
You're awake.

49
04:21.750 --> 04:23.125
Just in time.

50
04:23.125 --> 04:24.583
Just wait.

51
04:24.583 --> 04:26.800
It's all over now.

52
04:32.333 --> 04:34.625
You want us to die together?

53
04:34.625 --> 04:36.208
You're crazy.

54
04:36.208 --> 04:38.716
What good will that do you?

55
04:43.958 --> 04:45.417
Good?

56
04:45.417 --> 04:47.083
Chang Huan is gone.

57
04:47.083 --> 04:48.333
If you hadn't acted like a mad dog,

58
04:48.333 --> 04:50.292
guarding that immune body and getting in the way,

59
04:50.292 --> 04:52.000
Chang Huan would have been cured.

60
04:52.000 --> 04:53.541
It's you.

61
04:53.541 --> 04:55.375
You ruined everything.

62
04:55.375 --> 04:58.416
You made me lose the most important person to me.

63
04:58.416 --> 05:00.583
I want the person most important to you

64
05:00.583 --> 05:03.341
watch you burn to death.

65
05:06.375 --> 05:08.250
Setting a fire?

66
05:08.250 --> 05:10.425
There are innocent people out there.

67
05:15.542 --> 05:18.342
You're afraid of involving Lin Zai, right?

68
05:19.208 --> 05:21.458
Even if he doesn't burn to death,

69
05:21.458 --> 05:23.445
he won't survive anyway.

70
05:24.542 --> 05:26.467
What do you mean?

71
05:30.708 --> 05:32.916
He Rui.

72
05:32.916 --> 05:34.061
You're the one who brought them here.

73
05:34.061 --> 05:35.083
Yes.

74
05:35.083 --> 05:36.667
I brought them here.

75
05:36.667 --> 05:38.750
The main force will be here soon.

76
05:38.750 --> 05:41.167
He can't hide anymore.

77
05:41.167 --> 05:43.842
You're fucking crazy!

78
05:55.000 --> 05:57.883
Everyone can die with Chang Huan!

79
06:10.166 --> 06:11.583
Fire! There's a fire over there!

80
06:11.583 --> 06:13.167
It's the research lab!

81
06:13.167 --> 06:15.541
The research lab is on fire!

82
06:15.541 --> 06:17.583
Brother!

83
06:17.583 --> 06:19.083
Brother!

84
06:19.083 --> 06:22.175
- It's on fire! - Fire! Fire!

85
06:39.208 --> 06:40.583
Help! Fire!

86
06:40.583 --> 06:42.300
Get out of the way!

87
06:43.458 --> 06:44.875
Is anyone there?

88
06:44.875 --> 06:46.583
Lie! Lie!

89
06:46.583 --> 06:49.625
He Yao, are you in there?

90
06:49.625 --> 06:50.625
Lin Zai...

91
06:50.625 --> 06:51.667
Don't come in!

92
06:51.667 --> 06:53.375
Look.

93
06:53.375 --> 06:55.758
He's here to die with you.

94
06:56.625 --> 06:58.292
He will live on.

95
06:58.292 --> 06:59.625
Say something!

96
06:59.625 --> 07:01.416
And I will live with him, too.

97
07:01.416 --> 07:03.050
Lie!

98
07:05.333 --> 07:06.375
Lie!

99
07:06.375 --> 07:07.966
I've got this.

100
07:11.917 --> 07:13.509
Lie!

101
07:22.291 --> 07:24.091
You guys, get out of here!

102
07:27.958 --> 07:29.541
Chang Huan!

103
07:29.541 --> 07:31.383
Is that you?

104
07:32.125 --> 07:34.425
You've come to get me.

105
07:44.917 --> 07:46.250
Chang Huan.

106
07:46.250 --> 07:48.083
It's really you.

107
07:48.083 --> 07:49.125
You're not dead.

108
07:49.125 --> 07:50.759
You're still alive.

109
07:53.292 --> 07:55.300
Let's get out of here.

110
08:20.625 --> 08:22.675
Chang Huan.

111
08:30.250 --> 08:32.050
Why did you...

112
09:12.625 --> 09:14.216
Brother.

113
09:14.875 --> 09:16.883
It's over.

114
09:17.667 --> 09:19.676
Let's go home.

115
10:52.958 --> 10:56.088
I didn't expect it to end so tragically.

116
10:59.667 --> 11:01.917
What are you thinking about?

117
11:01.917 --> 11:03.836
This isn't over yet.

118
11:03.836 --> 11:06.302
The organization's main force is coming.

119
11:07.542 --> 11:09.750
Will there really be a lot of them?

120
11:09.750 --> 11:10.750
Yes.

121
11:10.750 --> 11:13.778
They won't give up easily.

122
11:13.778 --> 11:16.066
Then let's leave together.

123
11:16.066 --> 11:17.118
I'll stay.

124
11:17.118 --> 11:18.541
I'll stall for as long as I can.

125
11:18.541 --> 11:21.550
You guys evacuate first. I'll find a chance to escape.

126
11:24.667 --> 11:25.833
If we leave, we leave together.

127
11:25.833 --> 11:27.500
If we stay, we stay together.

128
11:27.500 --> 11:29.675
I won't be a burden to you.

129
11:31.208 --> 11:33.250
I can't let you take the risk.

130
11:33.250 --> 11:35.842
And you think I can just watch you take the risk?

131
11:38.041 --> 11:41.675
All this time, that's how I've lived.

132
11:43.500 --> 11:45.291
But you've met me now.

133
11:45.291 --> 11:46.792
What did you say before?

134
11:46.792 --> 11:48.254
You said you and I...

135
11:48.254 --> 11:50.262
Have you forgotten so soon?

136
11:56.625 --> 11:58.216
Fine.

137
11:59.833 --> 12:01.466
Let's leave together.

138
12:41.708 --> 12:43.508
I'm counting on you.

139
12:53.833 --> 12:55.425
Lie.

140
12:57.375 --> 12:59.000
Dao.

141
12:59.000 --> 13:00.333
Don't worry.

142
13:00.333 --> 13:01.916
I'll take good care of Lin Zai.

143
13:01.916 --> 13:03.841
We'll wait for you to rejoin us.

144
13:05.375 --> 13:07.868
Thank you. Take care.

145
13:11.250 --> 13:14.325
I scavenged these from them.

146
13:14.325 --> 13:16.292
You should keep them.

147
13:20.875 --> 13:22.675
You guys keep one, too.

148
13:28.042 --> 13:30.009
Be careful.

149
13:31.333 --> 13:32.925
Let's go.

150
17:31.666 --> 17:32.708
Lie Ri.

151
17:32.708 --> 17:34.550
You can't escape.

152
17:35.875 --> 17:39.714
Hand over the immune body, and we'll spare your life.

153
17:55.587 --> 17:57.179
Lie.

154
17:58.416 --> 18:00.008
Lin Zai.

155
18:10.958 --> 18:14.041
I'm the immune body you're looking for.

156
18:14.041 --> 18:15.750
If any of you touch him,

157
18:15.750 --> 18:17.925
I'll take you all down with me.

158
18:27.875 --> 18:29.058
Lie Ri.

159
18:29.058 --> 18:31.460
This is the last chance the organization is giving you.

160
18:32.145 --> 18:33.292
Hand over the immune body.

161
18:33.292 --> 18:36.417
- The organization can... - To hell with Lie Ri!

162
18:36.417 --> 18:38.509
His damn name is Gao Liang!

163
20:12.792 --> 20:14.592
Are you hurt?

164
20:17.666 --> 20:19.125
That bomb...

165
20:19.125 --> 20:20.883
Was it real or fake?

166
20:22.125 --> 20:23.750
I was just bluffing.

167
20:23.750 --> 20:25.217
See?

168
20:30.083 --> 20:32.750
But... Lie.

169
20:32.750 --> 20:35.966
I was serious about protecting you.

170
20:40.416 --> 20:42.833
You're not going to call me...

171
20:42.833 --> 20:44.717
Gao Liang anymore?

172
20:46.125 --> 20:47.542
It doesn't sound great.

173
20:47.542 --> 20:49.925
I'm still used to calling you as Lie.

174
20:52.792 --> 20:54.030
We're almost done packing.

175
20:54.030 --> 20:56.120
We'll have more firepower from now on.

176
20:57.208 --> 20:58.800
Let's go.

177
21:09.041 --> 21:10.675
Lie.

178
21:11.792 --> 21:13.458
You guys...

179
21:13.458 --> 21:15.417
Dao.

180
21:15.417 --> 21:17.842
We won't be going with you.

181
21:18.500 --> 21:21.841
I'll remember this kindness.

182
21:24.500 --> 21:26.417
Don't say that.

183
21:26.417 --> 21:27.666
I owed you my life.

184
21:27.666 --> 21:30.125
Now, I've repaid the favor.

185
21:30.125 --> 21:31.583
Take care, you two.

186
21:31.583 --> 21:33.542
I believe...

187
21:33.542 --> 21:35.336
we'll meet again.

188
21:37.500 --> 21:39.300
Take care on the road.

189
21:42.833 --> 21:44.466
Let's go.

190
21:51.583 --> 21:53.333
You brat.

191
21:53.333 --> 21:55.375
Remember to protect yourself.

192
21:55.375 --> 22:00.000
Maybe one day in the future, we'll cross paths again.

193
22:00.000 --> 22:03.000
Chen, I'll leave Grandma Qiu in your care.

194
22:03.000 --> 22:04.708
I'll take care of her.

195
22:04.708 --> 22:05.750
Lie.

196
22:05.750 --> 22:08.300
I'm leaving Lin Zai in your care.

197
22:12.000 --> 22:13.592
Bye.

198
22:22.333 --> 22:24.091
That trick again.

199
22:37.958 --> 22:39.550
Big Brother.

200
22:40.625 --> 22:44.647
Before you left, you told me to live a good life.

201
22:46.958 --> 22:49.216
But I was merely surviving.

202
22:55.292 --> 23:00.301
Now, I've found new meaning.

203
23:11.292 --> 23:18.000
[Lin Xian's Grave]

204
24:17.583 --> 24:23.875
[Lin Xian's Grave]

205
24:41.750 --> 24:43.215
Where are we going?

206
24:45.417 --> 24:46.875
The world is vast.

207
24:46.875 --> 24:49.994
As long as we're together, we can go anywhere.

208
27:35.708 --> 27:38.917
[The Apocalypse Lasts]

209
27:38.917 --> 27:52.542
[So Does The Oath]
